Phonon-2 Rust integration

Weight decoding, preprocessing, and ABI definitions derive from the
Apache-2.0 fermion-research 0.2.6 Python implementation.
Copyright 2026 Fermion Research.
https://pypi.org/project/fermion-research/0.2.6/
